-Data-Loading">=C2=B6</a></h2><p><strong>What is Exploratory Data Analysis =
(EDA)?</strong></p>
<p>EDA is the process of using summary statistics and visualizations to und=
erstand a dataset's main characteristics. Before you can build a model, you=
 need to understand your data:</p>
<ul>
<li>What stories does it tell?</li>
<li>Are there errors or missing values?</li>
<li>Are there strong relationships between variables?</li>
</ul>
<p>EDA helps answer these critical questions. We will use the famous Titani=
c dataset for this lab, which contains information about passengers and whe=
ther they survived the disaster.</p>

