<div class=3D"highlight hl-ipython3"><pre><span></span><span class=3D"c1">#=
 A FacetGrid allows us to create multiple plots side-by-side to compare dis=
tributions.</span>
<span class=3D"c1"># Here, we create one histogram for passengers who died =
(col=3D'Survived'=3D0) and one for those who survived (col=3D'Survived'=3D1=
).</span>
<span class=3D"n">g</span> <span class=3D"o">=3D</span> <span class=3D"n">s=
ns</span><span class=3D"o">.</span><span class=3D"n">FacetGrid</span><span =
class=3D"p">(</span><span class=3D"n">df</span><span class=3D"p">,</span> <=
span class=3D"n">col</span><span class=3D"o">=3D</span><span class=3D"s1">'=
Survived'</span><span class=3D"p">,</span> <span class=3D"n">height</span><=
span class=3D"o">=3D</span><span class=3D"mi">6</span><span class=3D"p">)</=
