<ul>
<li>Analysis &amp; Reflection:
Yes, where the passengers boarded does seem to be related to their survival=
. The visualization clearly shows that passengers who embarked from Cherbou=
rg (C) had a significantly higher survival rate, with the number of survivo=
rs actually exceeding those who died. In contrast, passengers who boarded a=
t Southampton (S) faced the worst odds, making up the vast majority of casu=
alties.</li>
</ul>

